WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inlet valve
What it does: Opens the path for the air-fuel charge to enter the cylinder, then seals it.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Inlet valve
How it works: The valve head leaves its seat and admits the charge.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Inlet valve
How it moves: Opens and closes following a fixed intake profile; does not switch lobes with engine speed.
